GET {{baseUrl}}/oauth/me

::: auth oauth2
profile = sample-browser

::: post
test("signed in through the browser", () => {
  expect(res.status).toBe(200);
  expect(res.json().grant).toBe("authorization_code");
});

::: docs
The authorization code grant with PKCE. The sample provider signs the demo user in at once, so
the browser tab closes the loop by itself. The automated suite has no browser and expects
"sign in from the Postino app first".
